al-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /> </a> </span></p> <ul> <li>링크/신청: <a href=\"https://www.ces.tech/\">https://www.ces.tech/</a> (신청)</li> <li>일시/장소: January 6 - 9 (현지시간), Las Vegas, US</li> <li>한줄설명: Innovators show up - 세계 최대 연례 가전 행사</li> <li>CES: Consumer Electronics Show</li> </ul> <h2>MWC26</h2> <p><span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \" > <a class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\" href=\"/static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/c56af/22.png\" style=\"display: block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" > <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 60.75949367088608%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url(\'data:image/png;base64,\'); background-size: cover; display: block;\" ></span> <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" alt=\"22.png\" title=\"\" src=\"/static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/f058b/22.png\" srcset=\"/static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/c26ae/22.png 158w, /static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/6bdcf/22.png 315w, /static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/f058b/22.png 630w, /static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/40601/22.png 945w, /static/cbe3b82cf40887e8b9b0c5fb50ebb98c/c56af/22.png 1231w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /> </a> </span></p> <ul> <li>링크/신청: <a href=\"https://www.mwcbarcelona.com/\">https://www.mwcbarcelona.com/</a> (신청)</li> <li>일시/장소: 2 - 5 March 2026 (현지시간), Barcelona, Spain</li> <li>한줄설명: 세계 최대 연례 모바일 통신 행사</li> <li>MWC: Mobile World Congress</li> </ul> <h2>NVIDIA GTC 2026</h2> <p><span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \" > <a class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\" href=\"/static/