 class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">혼자 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">환경 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">설정할 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">수 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">있게</span><span class=\"sp-syntax-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">CS팀이 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">결제 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">오류 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">직접 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">대응할 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">수 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">있게</span> |\n| **<span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">대상 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">독자</span>** | <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">누가 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">읽나요</span>? | <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">신규입사자</span><span class=\"sp-syntax-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">개발팀</span><span class=\"sp-syntax-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">전체 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">구성원</span> |\n| **<span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">디테일 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">수준</span>** | <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">개요 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">수준인가요</span><span class=\"sp-syntax-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">상세 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">레퍼런스인가요</span>? | <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">개념 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">이해용 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">개요</span><span class=\"sp-syntax-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">구현에 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">필요한 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">모든 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">파라미터 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">포함</span> |\n| **<span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">소스 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">자료</span>** | <span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">문서를 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">작성하기 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">위해 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\">참고할 </span><span class=\"sp-syntax-plain\