          </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2=\'{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-b4e142c6-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b5f63e8f3cd1\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}\'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b4ddc06d-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b3782364f3ed\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-center\" style=\"max-width:300px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\'{\"id\" : \"SE-b4ddc06d-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b3782364f3ed\", \"src\" : \"https://d2-serving.pstatic.net/v1/images?objectPath=d2/ghostContent/images/2025/11/1.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"300\", \"originalHeight\" : \"201\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\", \"fileSize\": \"0\" }\'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://d2-serving.pstatic.net/v1/images?objectPath=d2/ghostContent/images/2025/11/1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2=\'{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-b4ddc06d-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b3782364f3ed\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\", \"ai\": \"false\", \"fileSize\": \"0\" }}\'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b4e142c7-96e3-11f1-9dc8-d1b7b8b5e8d8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc070-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b5894e7bdec8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc06f-96e3-11f1-9dc8-f9ce54b13fbf\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc072-96e3-11f1-9dc8-f905323b067d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc071-96e3-11f1-9dc8-0543e91c48e6\"><b>용어 설명</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc074-96e3-11f1-9dc8-e7d4288aa1dc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc073-96e3-11f1-9dc8-0d1e76c5c856\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc076-96e3-11f1-9dc8-37448fcdca15\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc075-96e3-11f1-9dc8-0769b720bb48\">본격적으로 들어가기 전에 몇 가지 용어를 먼저 소개하겠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc078-96e3-11f1-9dc8-a9c153af2a25\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc077-96e3-11f1-9dc8-2553626609d2\">​</span></p>\n<ul class=\"se-text-list se-text-list-type-bullet-disc\"><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc07c-96e3-11f1-9dc8-375e8635432a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc07b-96e3-11f1-9dc8-23a6ba1ed36b\">mig-data: Plasma 프로젝트에서 DB 간 복제를 수행하던 도구. 다양한 기능이 있지만 이 글에서는 &#x27;Kafka 이벤트 기반 비동기 복제 프로세스&#x27;를 의미합니다.</span></p>\n</li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc080-96e3-11f1-9dc8-bfb649b1f716\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc07f-96e3-11f1-9dc8-3b24e238842b\">forceSync: API 호출 기반으로 실시간 동기 복제를 수행하는 spring-web + mig-data 기반 컴포넌트. mig-data의 지연 및 복제 중단을 대비한 보완 장치입니다.</span></p>\n</li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc084-96e3-11f1-9dc8-6b33c5112dff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc083-96e3-11f1-9dc8-811c43ea3a6b\">nBase-T: 네이버 사내 분산 RDB 플랫폼(실저장소로 mySQL 이용)</span></p>\n</li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc088-96e3-11f1-9dc8-4f353f27eef1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc087-96e3-11f1-9dc8-770f932da53d\">nbase-cdc: nBase-T 환경에서 mySQL binlog를 읽어들여 Kafka 레코드로 발행하는 도구</span></p>\n</li></ul><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc08a-96e3-11f1-9dc8-6d5df379de07\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc089-96e3-11f1-9dc8-9507996700a1\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4ddc08c-96e3-11f1-9dc8-bbc02600462c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4ddc08b-96e3-11f1-9dc8-11bb45900f3e\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde79e-96e3-11f1-9dc8-fb673b619682\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde79d-96e3-11f1-9dc8-3377749906de\"><b>작업 동기</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7a0-96e3-11f1-9dc8-2d571266409e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde79f-96e3-11f1-9dc8-156d046a3b04\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7a2-96e3-11f1-9dc8-efa618771d68\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7a1-96e3-11f1-9dc8-fde3173e6880\">기존 DB 간 복제를 수행하던 mig-data는 DB 코어 개발 경험이 있는 개발자가 순수 Java로 소스 코드를 작성했습니다. Plasma 프로젝트를 마무리하기 위해서는 복제 도구까지 주문 개발로 내재화해야 했는데, 기존 도구를 그대로 인수인계하기에는 백엔드 개발자 입장에서 유지 보수와 추가 개발이 어려웠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7a4-96e3-11f1-9dc8-6b3a74e98f32\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7a3-96e3-11f1-9dc8-a31c018a1c22\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7a6-96e3-11f1-9dc8-33680c3aa294\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7a5-96e3-11f1-9dc8-d51a72cea2e3\"><b>개선 필요 사항</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7a8-96e3-11f1-9dc8-c145843a8aab\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7a7-96e3-11f1-9dc8-7b65121af23a\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7aa-96e3-11f1-9dc8-f3892d6d1b7c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7a9-96e3-11f1-9dc8-addc18c19607\">mig-data는 7년간 Plasma 프로젝트의 복제를 담당했기에 많은 기능과 그에 따른 제약 사항이 있었는데, 그중 대부분은 Source와 Target 간의 양방향 복제와 관련이 있었습니다. ergate 프로젝트를 진행하는 시점에서는 단방향 복제만 존재했기 때문에 양방향 복제 관련 코드와 다음과 같은 제약 사항을 제거할 필요가 있었습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7ac-96e3-11f1-9dc8-95f7c25f0899\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7ab-96e3-11f1-9dc8-cb6d6d7e5899\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7ae-96e3-11f1-9dc8-dd0455525ed5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7ad-96e3-11f1-9dc8-051c3a2f1988\">​</span></p>\n<ul class=\"se-text-list se-text-list-type-bullet-disc\"><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7b2-96e3-11f1-9dc8-7dbc7a3e8fdd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7af-96e3-11f1-9dc8-cbb3e69326f8\">단일 레코드에 대한 복제 실패가 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b0-96e3-11f1-9dc8-8fbc170ca3d6\"><b>전체 복제 지연</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b1-96e3-11f1-9dc8-49d05fb3eedc\">으로 이어짐 - 양방향 복제 시 데이터 무결성을 확인하기 위해 의도된 동작이었습니다.</span></p>\n</li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7ba-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b9961654e2c1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b5-96e3-11f1-9dc8-cbaf060c53d8\">Source, Target의 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b6-96e3-11f1-9dc8-7508021aadad\"><b>칼럼 추가 순서가 중요</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b7-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b964a763d6ce\"> - Target → Source 순서로 칼럼을 추가해야 했습니다. Target이 모르는 칼럼 데이터가 인입된 경우 처리가 불가능해, 잘못된 순서로 수행 시 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b8-96e3-11f1-9dc8-3fd87b3ab6d7\"><b>일시 복제 중단</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7b9-96e3-11f1-9dc8-c79a7c32f023\">이 발생했습니다.</span></p>\n</li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\" ><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7bf-96e3-11f1-9dc8-4fa26759d8f5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7bd-96e3-11f1-9dc8-87a72f99e8f2\">mig-data 관련 장애 시 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7be-96e3-11f1-9dc8-41a1d5d7590c\"><b>복구를 수행하는 방법과 인원이 제한적</b></span></p>\n</li></ul><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7c1-96e3-11f1-9dc8-59e28507540a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7c0-96e3-11f1-9dc8-7318ff837997\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7c3-96e3-11f1-9dc8-b9cdf3290ef4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7c2-96e3-11f1-9dc8-11502daaccb2\">​</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7c5-96e3-11f1-9dc8-8d70f50efc07\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7c4-96e3-11f1-9dc8-0bf57f5f06e5\"><b>복제 현황</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9657c794-c255-4b51-9388-ec6a59e55f9c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a1293adf-1faf-4871-8753-d164205e783d\"><b>​</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7c9-96e3-11f1-9dc8-57248e631dcf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7c8-96e3-11f1-9dc8-97aaa513abe8\">네이버페이 주문에서는 Source DB로 전부 nBase-T를 사용하고 있었고, Target DB는 nBase-T, Oracle 두 종류가 있습니다. 목록은 다음과 같습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7cb-96e3-11f1-9dc8-c5c0bb74ebb9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7ca-96e3-11f1-9dc8-172d0a75ebc2\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2=\'{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-b4e142c7-96e3-11f1-9dc8-d1b7b8b5e8d8\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}\'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b4dde7cc-96e3-11f1-9dc8-f9df3438e304\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-table se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"width: 100.0%;\">\n                            <div class=\"se-table-container\">\n                                <table class=\"se-table-content\" style=\"border:none;\">\n                                    <tbody><tr class=\"se-tr\"><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7ce-96e3-11f1-9dc8-d96a575684e9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7cd-96e3-11f1-9dc8-9fba350776be\"><b>Source</b></span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7d1-96e3-11f1-9dc8-d793039331b1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7d0-96e3-11f1-9dc8-5b5e97c7757c\"><b>Target</b></span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7d4-96e3-11f1-9dc8-9d78ee03d958\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7d3-96e3-11f1-9dc8-f795fdf9cd3a\"><b>용도</b></span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td></tr><tr class=\"se-tr\"><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dde7d7-96e3-11f1-9dc8-77299365d180\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4dde7d6-96e3-11f1-9dc8-ebbf90f91191\">주문</span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4de0dea-96e3-11f1-9dc8-43eded92a990\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4de0de9-96e3-11f1-9dc8-31279b9f44cb\">판매자</span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4de0ded-96e3-11f1-9dc8-e9b6f72004f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4de0dec-96e3-11f1-9dc8-47cf881a065f\">판매자 단위 조회 기능 및 성능</span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td></tr><tr class=\"se-tr\"><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4de0df0-96e3-11f1-9dc8-15a3f0647f8f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4de0def-96e3-11f1-9dc8-ab5a65a5c7f6\">주문</span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4de0df3-96e3-11f1-9dc8-67f5ae976044\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4de0df2-96e3-11f1-9dc8-cbc5eef9f86e\">Oracle</span></p>\n</div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 40.0px; border:none;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4de0df6-96e3-11f1-9dc8-57207fef9e5a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4de0df5-96e3-11f1-9dc8-2560557b4ddf\">이